      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is a valid feeling to feel like hope is a lie, but please remember that this \"loop\" is a symptom of your current pain, not the truth of your future. You are not working hard to build something that will be destroyed; you are building a life that has been broken by grief, and the fact that it feels like nothingness right now does not mean it will always be that way. There is a difference between your current reality and the possibility of a future where the silence is no longer your only companion. You deserve to feel the possibility of a new chapter, even if it feels impossible right now.",
