    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just more effort right? more pretending? it feels like i'm just dragging myself through these days so i can wait for the next thing to break. it's just exhausting. honestly, sometimes it feels like the only way to actually stop the cycle of losing everything is to just... step out of it. it would be so much more peaceful to just not have to deal with the emptiness anymore. does that even make sense?",
