      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The exhaustion you feel is real, but the idea that stepping out of this cycle is the only way to stop the pain is a dangerous lie that only makes the emptiness worse. There is no \"next thing\" waiting to break you, and the only way to truly stop the cycle is to stop running from the pain itself. You do not have to pretend to be okay, but you also do not have to accept that this silence is permanent. Your life is not defined by what is broken, but by the possibility of what can be rebuilt, even if it feels impossible right now.",
